@startuml CampusMaster Use Case Diagram
left to right direction

!define ACTOR actor
!define USECASE usecase

' ===== ACTEURS =====
ACTOR Etudiant
ACTOR Enseignant
ACTOR Admin

' ===== SYSTÈME =====
